silm:instances_papers_21_ologs_and_typed_english_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_05_bridge_to_22_cco_style_ontology_concrete_anchor_3_BFO_continuant#bfocontinuantbox silm:hasLongDescription "The BfoContinuantBox is a BFO-rooted noun-box shared between CCO and O_eng. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'BFO_continuant', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
